title: A card is moved by its title and made larger or smaller by its sides and corner, and keeps that place after a restart
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
right symbols
left changes
wait 900
mark a-docked
wait 400
ui drag 1400 60 700 260
wait 900
mark b-moved
wait 400
ui drag 997 500 1150 500
wait 600
ui drag 1145 878 1145 640
wait 900
mark c-resized
wait 400
quit

=== again
wait 3500
mark d-after-restart
wait 400
quit
